error[RB0316]: field `from` of event `Hello` cannot be `ref Peer`
 --> RB0316-ref-not-allowed.road:2:23
  |
2 |   event Hello { from: ref Peer }
  |                       ^^^^^^^^
  |
  = help: a machine gets a `ref` only as a parameter of its own, or through `invoke … as name`, so that who can talk to whom shows in the charts' signatures; pass it as a parameter instead

